<title>USA: SmartServ managment buys shares from Laifer.</title>
<headline>SmartServ managment buys shares from Laifer.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmartServ Online Inc said Monday that members of senior management and its board of directors have bought a total of 97,735 shares of company stock from privately held Laifer Capital Management Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>SmartServ shares traded at 2-7/16 mid-Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>The company provides business and entertainment information via personal computers, screen phones,alpha-numeric pagerss, enhanced television and set-top boxes, and the Internet.</p>
</text>
